d audio files and DALL-E enabling image generation.\n\nThe platform's data ingest and training are model-agnostic, ensuring secure training of proprietary data without ingesting it into the models. This approach allows Ask Sage to implement data-centric security and label data on a per-user basis, sharing labels with team members as needed and preventing data spillage while enabling zero-trust security.\n\nAsk Sage can ingest custom data (up to CUI/FOUO), connect to APIs, and access data lakes for real-time insights, delivering human-like responses to assist teams with labor-intensive tasks and enabling them to focus on strategic initiatives. The platform can be fully automated by GPT agents, decision trees and plugin integrations to access data lakes, knowledge bases, and APIs.","event_log":[{"date":"2023-11-04T04:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status set to Agency Authorization In Process","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class D"},{"date":"2024-06-24T04:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status changed from Agency Authorization In Process to FedRAMP In Process","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class D"},{"date":"2025-01-24T05:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status changed from FedRAMP In Process to FedRAMP Certified","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class D"}]},"kept":{"annual_assessment":{"value":"06/21","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"Annual assessment"},"auth_date":{"value":"2025-01-24","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"Authorization date"},"fedramp_auth_date":{"value":"2025-01-24","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"FedRAMP authorization date"},"impact_level":{"value":"High","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"Impact level"},"partnering_agency":{"value":"Drug Enforcem